This product includes software derived from the Phantom project, which is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Spectre has been substantially modified from that work. Notable changes:

  - The interface was redesigned and the source strings translated to English.
  - The update mechanism was rewritten. The original fetched release metadata
    from a third-party domain and rendered the response as HTML; it has been
    replaced with a check against this project's own repository that builds its
    UI through DOM APIs only.
  - Scanning, extraction and export modules were extended and refactored.
